(* The build file of the sources of runedoc, the documentation generator
  (docs/plans/docgen.md): the compiler's utilities, frontend and elaborator,
  which it shares with rune.build in the same order, and src/doc.
  scripts/gen-build-files.sh makes the build files of every host from this
  file -- edit only this file. The rules of rune.build hold here too. *)
